1
00:00:00,744 --> 00:00:03,084
(Penny:)I remember you saying how great
it would be to have a first edition.

2
00:00:03,814 --> 00:00:06,724
(Leonard:)It's true, I did. I did say that...

3
00:00:06,884 --> 00:00:09,224
(Leonard:)...when we were at
the used bookstore together

4
00:00:09,386 --> 00:00:12,296
(Leonard:)and I saw the first edition
and I bought it.

5
00:00:13,991 --> 00:00:16,971
Oh my God, I am the worst!

6
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:18,667
No, no, ifs okay.
It's really thoughtful.

7
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:20,499
No, ifs not! I mean...

8
00:00:21,765 --> 00:00:24,075
Whats thoughtful
is everything you do.

9
00:00:26,170 --> 00:00:28,170
(Penny:)Here, you know what?
Look at this.

10
00:00:29,974 --> 00:00:32,144
(Penny:)Look, here's the...
the plane ticket you bought me

11
00:00:32,309 --> 00:00:34,519
(Penny:)when I was too poor
to go home for the holidays.

12
00:00:34,678 --> 00:00:38,688
(Penny:)And the rose you left
on my windshield... just because.

13
00:00:39,583 --> 00:00:41,463
Here's the thank-you letter
you wrote me

14
00:00:41,619 --> 00:00:43,189
(Penny:)after the first time
I slept with you.

15
00:00:44,855 --> 00:00:47,525
(Penny:)All 11 pages of it.

16
00:00:49,927 --> 00:00:51,597
(Amy:)Can't believe
you saved all this stuff.

17
00:00:53,163 --> 00:00:55,473
(Penny:)Of course I did. It's you.

18
00:00:57,868 --> 00:01:04,028
(Leonard:)Come here.

